<html>
  <head>
    <meta charset='UTF-8' />
    <title>Email Verification</title>
    <link
      href='https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;600;700&display=swap'
      rel='stylesheet'
    />
    <style>
      body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; background-color: #f9f9f9;
      margin: 0; padding: 0; color: #333; } .container { background-color:
      #ffffff; max-width: 700px; margin: 40px auto; border-radius: 10px;
      box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1); overflow: hidden; border-top:
      5px solid #2e7d32; } .header { background: linear-gradient(90deg, #2e7d32
      0%, #388e3c 100%); padding: 30px; text-align: center; color: white; }
      .header h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 24px; text-transform: uppercase; }
      .section { padding: 30px; line-height: 1.6; } .section h2 { color:
      #2e7d32; font-size: 20px; } .verification-box { margin: 20px 0; padding:
      25px; border-radius: 6px; background-color: #f3f4f6; border: 2px dashed
      #2e7d32; color: #333; font-weight: 600; text-align: center; }
      .verification-button { display: inline-block; padding: 15px 30px; margin:
      15px 0; background: linear-gradient(90deg, #2e7d32 0%, #388e3c 100%);
      color: white !important; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 8px;
      font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; border: none; cursor: pointer;
      transition: all 0.3s ease; box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(46, 125, 50, 0.3);
      } .verification-button:hover { background: linear-gradient(90deg, #1b5e20
      0%, #2e7d32 100%); box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(46, 125, 50, 0.4);
      transform: translateY(-2px); } .warning-box { margin: 20px 0; padding:
      20px; border-radius: 6px; background-color: #fef3c7; border: 1px solid
      #f59e0b; color: #92400e; font-size: 14px; } .footer { font-size: 12px;
      color: #777; text-align: center; padding: 25px; background-color: #f1f8f2;
      } .footer a { color: #2e7d32; text-decoration: none; } .greeting {
      font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 16px; } .paragraph {
      margin-bottom: 16px; font-size: 14px; } .signature { margin-top: 24px;
      font-size: 14px; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class='container'>
      <div class='header'>
        <h1>ASFAAR VISA SERVICES</h1>
      </div>

      <div class='section'>
        <h2 class='greeting'>Hello {{userName}},</h2>

        <p class='paragraph'>
          Thank you for registering with Asfaar Visa Services. To complete your
          account setup and ensure the security of your account, please verify
          your email address by clicking the button below.
        </p>

        <div class='verification-box'>
          <p>Click the button below to verify your email address:</p>
          <a href='{{verificationLink}}' class='verification-button'>Verify
            Email Address</a>
          <p>This link will expire in <strong>24 hours</strong></p>
        </div>

        <div class='warning-box'>
          <strong>Security Notice:</strong>
          If you didn't request this email verification, please ignore this
          email and consider changing your password if you have an existing
          account. Never share this link with anyone.
        </div>

        <p class='paragraph'>
          If you're having trouble with the verification button, you can also
          copy and paste the following link into your browser:
        </p>

        <p
          class='paragraph'
          style='word-break: break-all; font-size: 12px; color: #666;'
        >
          {{verificationLink}}
        </p>

        <p class='paragraph'>
          If you're having trouble with verification, please contact our support
          team for assistance.
        </p>

        <p class='signature'>
          Best regards,<br />
          The Asfaar Team
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class='footer'>
        <p>For inquiries:
          <a
            href='mailto:info@asfaarvisaservices.com'
          >info@asfaarvisaservices.com</a>
          | Visit:
          <a
            href='https://www.asfaarvisaservices.com'
          >www.asfaarvisaservices.com</a></p>
        <p><strong>Hotline:</strong>
          +234 700 700 4001 |
          <strong>Open Hours:</strong>
          Mon-Fri 08:00 - 18:00</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>